T1  - Radiation-induced transformations of matrix-isolated ethanol molecules at cryogenic temperatures: an FTIR study
PY  - 2023
Y1  - 2023/09/07
DO  - 10.1039/d3cp02834h
JO  - Physical Chemistry Chemical Physics
JA  - Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys.
